subject=TNF&object=IL1B&type=Inhibition&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">98</a>)<li/>TNF decreases the amount of IL1B(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=IL1B&type=DecreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">43</a>)<li/>TNF dephosphorylates IL1B(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=IL1B&type=Dephosphorylation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">2</a>)<li/>IL1B activates TNF(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=IL1B&object=TNF&type=Activation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">473</a>)<li/>IL1B increases the amount of TNF(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=IL1B&object=TNF&type=IncreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">241</a>)<li/>IL1B inhibits TNF(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=IL1B&object=TNF&type=Inhibition&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">88</a>)<li/>IL1B decreases the amount of TNF(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=IL1B&object=TNF&type=DecreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">34</a>)<li/>IL1B phosphorylates TNF(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=IL1B&object=TNF&type=Phosphorylation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">2</a>)</ul>","__relationship_score":7.516977224604321,"i":"interacts with"}},{"id":99,"s":23,"t":29,"v":{"Relationships":"All Evidences (<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?agent0=MAPK1&agent1=TNF&format=html&expand_all=false\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">96</a>)<ul><li/>TNF activates MAPK1(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=MAPK1&type=Activation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">59</a>)<li/>TNF phosphorylates MAPK1(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=T