a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=3&#x27;,5&#x27;-cyclic AMP&object=TNF&type=DecreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">22</a>)<li/>3',5'-cyclic AMP increases the amount of TNF(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=3&#x27;,5&#x27;-cyclic AMP&object=TNF&type=IncreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">13</a>)<li/>3',5'-cyclic AMP phosphorylates TNF(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=3&#x27;,5&#x27;-cyclic AMP&object=TNF&type=Phosphorylation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">2</a>)<li/>TNF activates 3',5'-cyclic AMP(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=3&#x27;,5&#x27;-cyclic AMP&type=Activation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">61</a>)<li/>TNF inhibits 3',5'-cyclic AMP(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=3&#x27;,5&#x27;-cyclic AMP&type=Inhibition&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">33</a>)<li/>TNF increases the amount of 3',5'-cyclic AMP(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=3&#x27;,5&#x27;-cyclic AMP&type=IncreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">27</a>)<li/>TNF decreases the amount of 3',5'-cyclic AMP(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=3&#x27;,5&#x27;-cyclic AMP&type=DecreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">8</a>)<li/>TNF binds 3',5'-cyclic AMP(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=3&#x27;,5&#x27;-cyclic AMP&type=Complex&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">3</a>)<li/>TNF phosphorylates 3',5'-cyclic AMP(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=TNF&object=3&#x27;,5&#x27;-cyclic AMP&type=Phosphorylation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">2</a>)</ul>","__relationship_score":5.8888